// A DRY PIPE VALVE LOSS CURVE THAT, EXTENDED TO NO FLOW, ADDS PRESSURE.
// EXPECT: 3 REJECTED
UNITS LENGTH M
UNITS ELEVATION M
UNITS SIZE MM
UNITS PRESSURE KPA
UNITS FLOW LPM
UNITS KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD HW
USE BORE 120
WATER W 0 700
NODE A 0
NODE B 0
SPRINKLER S 0 -50 80
PIPE P1 W A 5 100
PIPE P12 A B 5 100
PIPE P2 B S 5 50
DPV P12 100 RATIO 5.5:1 OFF 1000 20 2000 50
